// The world in 2024, as a scenario.
//
// This file is the second half of the base campaign. The world itself is assembled from
// history/ - which is where its countries, their figures, their regions, their treaties and
// their wars live - and what is left over is scenario-shaped rather than world-shaped, so it
// is written here.
//
//   player_country   who the scenario hands the player before they have chosen anybody.
//                    Any tag in map_data works, and the country picker can still change it:
//                    this is the seat the campaign opens on, not a restriction.
{
  "id": "2024",
  "name": "The world in 2024",
  "description": "1 January 2024. Russia and Ukraine are two years into the largest war in Europe since 1945; Gaza is burning; Sudan, Myanmar and the Sahel are coming apart. The United States leads an order China is learning to contest, and India, Turkey, Brazil and the Gulf want a seat of their own. Every country on the map can be played.",
  "player_country": "KOR"
}
